5. **Regulatory Framework Compliance**: Utilize our experience with EU regulatory frameworks, including CNIL guidance and HAS guidance on AI in healthcare, to ensure that our solution complies with relevant regulations.

By following these steps, we can ensure that our solution meets all necessary regulatory requirements and minimizes potential compliance risks associated with this project.
